<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"/><view class="detail-top"><button class="back" bindtap="back">‹</button><view class="detail-title">路线详情</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在打开路线…</view><block wx:else wx:if="{{route}}"><view class="hero-panel"><text class="route-tag">{{route.tag|| (route.source_type==='community'?'大家分享':'系统精选')}}</text><view class="hero-title">{{route.title}}</view><view class="hero-copy">{{route.description}}</view><view class="facts">⌖ {{route.district}}　◷ {{route.duration}}　¥ {{route.budget}}</view></view><view class="section"><view class="paper-card stop-card"><view class="form-title">这次怎么走</view><block wx:for="{{route.stops}}" wx:key="index"><view class="stop"><text>{{item[0]}}</text><view><b>{{item[1]}}</b><view>{{item[2]}}</view></view></view></block></view></view><view class="section"><view class="paper-card detail-note"><view class="form-title">出发前看一眼</view><view class="form-help">开放时间、预约要求和天气变化请在出发前再确认。这份路线留出了足够的自由时间，不需要严格照着走。</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{invitations.length}}" class="section"><view class="section-head"><view class="section-heading">基于这条路线的邀约</view></view><block wx:for="{{invitations}}" wx:key="_id"><view class="invite-card compact"><view class="status-pill">{{item.status==='open'?'正在邀约':'已结束'}}</view><view class="invite-title">{{item.start_time}} · {{item.meet_place}}</view><view class="invite-copy">{{item.member_count}}/{{item.max_people}} 人 · {{item.pace}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.joined}}" class="secondary-btn" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="chat">进入本次群聊</button><button wx:elif="{{item.status==='open'}}" class="secondary-btn" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="join">加入这次同行</button></view></block></view><view class="sticky-action"><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="adopt">{{planId?'已在我的计划里':'采用为我的计划'}}</button></view><block wx:if="{{showChoices}}"><view class="modal-mask"/><view class="bottom-sheet"><view class="sheet-handle"/><view class="sheet-title">这次想怎么出发？</view><view class="sheet-copy">先成为你的计划；同行是可选的下一步。</view><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="solo">自己慢慢去</button><button class="secondary-btn sheet-btn" bindtap="invite">基于这次计划发起同行</button></view></block><block wx:if="{{showInviteForm}}"><view class="modal-mask"/><view class="bottom-sheet"><view class="sheet-handle"/><view class="sheet-title">发起一次同行</view><view class="sheet-copy">这是一场具体的出发，不是开放式陌生人社交。</view><label class="field-label">出发时间<input class="field-input" data-field="startTime" value="{{startTime}}" bindinput="inviteInput"/></label><label class="field-label">集合地点<input class="field-input" data-field="meetPlace" value="{{meetPlace}}" bindinput="inviteInput"/></label><label class="field-label">想说的话<textarea class="field-textarea short" data-field="inviteNote" value="{{inviteNote}}" bindinput="inviteInput"/></label><button class="primary-btn sheet-btn" bindtap="submitInvite">发布这次同行</button></view></block></block></view>